{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:53:14Z","created_by_operation":"op_0f837166a77e4254b223d0c0aed8c3a0","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_1b8fd2aea85360a738384d01064ba470c340b1df8093e9d7a6ab025221652d2e","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"harnesslab/claw-code-agent@167571da895b snapshot 76b0b0a684f15cec","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_3812368cef3c92f2ad01485cb8aa37e130df705474308f701d5d577625ca6a55","slc_5c5df33870697b4fa8aa4deae3cb216fbf94c5025bf7feedd84213e2a840e231","slc_7cce6c516d4c1d5e103fa173c0f8ac26b0fe20d2febdfb3662dfd0ca0e8186b0","slc_af01ac9d76fd2df5692e0ccd2fb5edc5ca417500ae35175855a10c5d979f54ba"],"source_ids":["src_4d39afdf29635e9fbfa9f7b3eb7a2a1a"],"text":"The runtime targets OpenAI-compatible chat-completions endpoints, so it can run against vLLM, Ollama, LiteLLM Proxy, or OpenRouter, configured via OPENAI_BASE_URL, OPENAI_API_KEY, and OPENAI_MODEL environment variables.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:53:14Z","updated_by_operation":"op_0f837166a77e4254b223d0c0aed8c3a0"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:53:14Z","created_by_operation":"op_0f837166a77e4254b223d0c0aed8c3a0","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.5,"id":"clm_27df6666ccd0f7ebc90a4f0045db98cfa00fdfe72f60bd45da6584394ac1a0f7","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=inference; facet=evaluation","setting":"harnesslab/claw-code-agent@167571da895b snapshot 76b0b0a684f15cec","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_4540f480d9ea056d9b0010932c6e6234a32f4a3980d4d2b779defedef863618f","slc_aca69d65a0b2f782514013674d40e2305c5aaa4d4d340fd673ba1a8dccf76c49","slc_cf986633ab9887b5dfd58d87e64ce30369a6a5b033e30c5ebeffcccce782b864"],"source_ids":["src_4d39afdf29635e9fbfa9f7b3eb7a2a1a"],"text":"No evidence in the provided slices describes benchmark or success-rate evaluation of the agent's task performance; the testing material shown covers manual verification commands and a unit-test suite, so evaluation capability appears undocumented here.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:53:14Z","updated_by_operation":"op_0f837166a77e4254b223d0c0aed8c3a0"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:53:14Z","created_by_operation":"op_0f837166a77e4254b223d0c0aed8c3a0","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_3439f5afccb53b9741c278e9f1bdb7f9502888d179f34c36e4519aba28cd4445","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"harnesslab/claw-code-agent@167571da895b snapshot 76b0b0a684f15cec","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_49848e9c8264e62c36c24e19ad76c2dc657c3685a7b938a8d8b67a1ba4a15dbf","slc_ad154e93621617ec862a9f2b5d48b4e83a7be8d17a60e264141fd57def72b3b6"],"source_ids":["src_4d39afdf29635e9fbfa9f7b3eb7a2a1a"],"text":"The runtime journals file edits with snapshot IDs and replays summaries on session resume, and performs context reduction via auto-snip, auto-compact, and reactive compaction on prompt-too-long errors.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:53:14Z","updated_by_operation":"op_0f837166a77e4254b223d0c0aed8c3a0"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:53:14Z","created_by_operation":"op_0f837166a77e4254b223d0c0aed8c3a0","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_49ed32724be8ced80e132fb169279f28b734da1360b23520722e1a067d0d9c43","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=specifications","setting":"harnesslab/claw-code-agent@167571da895b snapshot 76b0b0a684f15cec","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1243eac1498f99595ffba4c3c91f96442cd702c0db02c225f8fdbae9af123d5e","slc_c4aad59cbeb1894485404a30e42347ae78d48d014a4971cd12827a0b71b7372f","slc_d0d246dc11da4e6f156a1267bb4b906691820381f4aecff163197f56ead0affa"],"source_ids":["src_4d39afdf29635e9fbfa9f7b3eb7a2a1a"],"text":"The project is a Python reimplementation of the Claude Code npm agent architecture, intended to run with local open-source models via an OpenAI-compatible API server, and is marked alpha status.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:53:14Z","updated_by_operation":"op_0f837166a77e4254b223d0c0aed8c3a0"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:53:14Z","created_by_operation":"op_0f837166a77e4254b223d0c0aed8c3a0","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_5ed82571ba63f94477dfc56eae68522e232af11a454cecbd9ce985a1fd08a57c","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"harnesslab/claw-code-agent@167571da895b snapshot 76b0b0a684f15cec","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_23fb04dc6e85d991edc9f596c1c334164c208c2563a00fd437c179da41ce56f9","slc_ccba1e3e061b417d68a03708f3b3e1eb14b2144f2e61b892783d614087e732de"],"source_ids":["src_4d39afdf29635e9fbfa9f7b3eb7a2a1a"],"text":"The runtime uses a tiered permission system: read-only tools run by default, file writes require --allow-write, shell execution requires --allow-shell, and destructive shell operations require --unsafe.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:53:14Z","updated_by_operation":"op_0f837166a77e4254b223d0c0aed8c3a0"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:53:14Z","created_by_operation":"op_0f837166a77e4254b223d0c0aed8c3a0","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_7358ceb516d9aa7947f5561e45ab94d18041cc7739557d51cc448a20cdb28fbd","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"harnesslab/claw-code-agent@167571da895b snapshot 76b0b0a684f15cec","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_df705fc45c504e622c7f0ece6cb1866033535a267c2d3d1b94a80b122e27c210"],"source_ids":["src_4d39afdf29635e9fbfa9f7b3eb7a2a1a"],"text":"CLI flags include --cwd, --model, --base-url, --allow-write, --allow-shell, --unsafe, --stream, --show-transcript, system-prompt override/append flags, and --add-dir for extra context directories.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:53:14Z","updated_by_operation":"op_0f837166a77e4254b223d0c0aed8c3a0"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:53:14Z","created_by_operation":"op_0f837166a77e4254b223d0c0aed8c3a0","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_73abd09d3eae24df164486118329741a5528ebf7149116da8646032eeee4786d","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"harnesslab/claw-code-agent@167571da895b snapshot 76b0b0a684f15cec","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_650ae1765e6fa85414f6cb729cc1722e253f9c7d21dba70dd9d990f642998d9d","slc_976affbcd76e9f0d197e258d0e61e9576f7d5fd7321133deff825ca899d7a9c3"],"source_ids":["src_4d39afdf29635e9fbfa9f7b3eb7a2a1a"],"text":"Slash commands are handled locally before the model loop and include /help, /context, /token-budget, /mcp, /search, /remote, /account, /config, /plan, and /tasks, some with aliases.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:53:14Z","updated_by_operation":"op_0f837166a77e4254b223d0c0aed8c3a0"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:53:14Z","created_by_operation":"op_0f837166a77e4254b223d0c0aed8c3a0","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_7c848f1f5cfd100f5745b05a71118e1b0679739eb7b3f04b2088daa30a317b90","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"harnesslab/claw-code-agent@167571da895b snapshot 76b0b0a684f15cec","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_bd4d5c51a823383c30259460c7571e74c7cd9d3195189017445773011bf22319","slc_e09112d1278763833440ed765fffc1c24a65f6b9f605987b0fe70089b5cc6f12"],"source_ids":["src_4d39afdf29635e9fbfa9f7b3eb7a2a1a"],"text":"The core agent runtime claims zero external dependencies, using only Python's standard library, and requires Python 3.10 or higher.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:53:14Z","updated_by_operation":"op_0f837166a77e4254b223d0c0aed8c3a0"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:53:14Z","created_by_operation":"op_0f837166a77e4254b223d0c0aed8c3a0","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_8fe274e968ca44742149f041559556a60c87fb6c0b0b9e87d290caed704527a3","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"harnesslab/claw-code-agent@167571da895b snapshot 76b0b0a684f15cec","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_577ab93c0396cbdb82904cbcba8a7ca5ff6bee0f2650b5df78a32aac0ac72702"],"source_ids":["src_4d39afdf29635e9fbfa9f7b3eb7a2a1a"],"text":"Using the OpenRouter backend sends conversation content, including file contents and shell output, to OpenRouter and upstream providers, so the docs warn against using it with repos containing secrets.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:53:14Z","updated_by_operation":"op_0f837166a77e4254b223d0c0aed8c3a0"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:53:14Z","created_by_operation":"op_0f837166a77e4254b223d0c0aed8c3a0","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_962cc2f29218731e519f78452cdee8c4f3f3be860d05a27e87f0d95d75755310","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"harnesslab/claw-code-agent@167571da895b snapshot 76b0b0a684f15cec","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1260e814275ce4328cc2668e8104f9366d5d1742c50a5b575b639986f7e730c1","slc_36eb1632856202256ef19ae2c40d0e12b79f10eb91e9da7ac407fef3640654f8","slc_7ddc18e5aa9611de47b8c37b67a3297f91eb707a9c8dfcefe40329d4c25378de","slc_db5e58128d6823b7e0b484caed976f03df9b8f9e7925a39d8e509d0d2d5e6fbc"],"source_ids":["src_4d39afdf29635e9fbfa9f7b3eb7a2a1a"],"text":"Each agent run automatically saves a resumable session under .port_sessions/agent, and agent-resume or agent-chat --resume-session-id continues from the saved transcript when run from the same directory.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:53:14Z","updated_by_operation":"op_0f837166a77e4254b223d0c0aed8c3a0"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:53:14Z","created_by_operation":"op_0f837166a77e4254b223d0c0aed8c3a0","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_98b5a747dba0c757eab9a49ce7d7835ad715ef45cedfef9f4c8d0aed8419f91b","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"harnesslab/claw-code-agent@167571da895b snapshot 76b0b0a684f15cec","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_37357a086c4038c2b28a978b7c17d7c4dc4d7218df03b5aff030f5b7e383e5d8"],"source_ids":["src_df0b0e7dce955ca8b067b22177d2c60b"],"text":"The parity checklist states that large parts of the mirrored Python workspace still act as inventory or scaffolding, with the working runtime concentrated in a subset of src modules.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:53:14Z","updated_by_operation":"op_0f837166a77e4254b223d0c0aed8c3a0"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:53:14Z","created_by_operation":"op_0f837166a77e4254b223d0c0aed8c3a0","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_9947e82547faea7814776546f9488279bda00d83903c189a86a8af787dfb9670","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"harnesslab/claw-code-agent@167571da895b snapshot 76b0b0a684f15cec","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_288df4e03e459016abbd9502386e3cca14a63c25c290da06d7e0be013f897bc2","slc_891709c7bc2d763e6cfe105887c0915c8a7d5b000a2b20864d4c59e4a2d671cb","slc_9d95a9dd1eb74965766bf5b269549cfc75ba034f98e42a7618ce5940dc5d99e4","slc_a68f0dc736c9da34c05f8b777c9bd438e6497080c559bdc875b5175177497e4c"],"source_ids":["src_4d39afdf29635e9fbfa9f7b3eb7a2a1a"],"text":"A local browser GUI launched via python -m src.gui serves a dark-themed chat UI at 127.0.0.1:8765 by default, with sessions sidebar, slash-command palette, live settings, budget editing, and a Tasks tab backed by .port_sessions/task_runtime.json.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:53:14Z","updated_by_operation":"op_0f837166a77e4254b223d0c0aed8c3a0"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:53:14Z","created_by_operation":"op_0f837166a77e4254b223d0c0aed8c3a0","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_9a30e4f405acee7d4b67511af415b894718100738deb3caf02705a627adb8555","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"harnesslab/claw-code-agent@167571da895b snapshot 76b0b0a684f15cec","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_d61a4e43c989e786cedb553d5f976fa7e7a924ac78159170b7542d5ffc8f002b","slc_dda9322df3d42793d7aa1877ecc2874b8ec0cdb342fbc795cb1bcef032c4c264"],"source_ids":["src_4d39afdf29635e9fbfa9f7b3eb7a2a1a"],"text":"The agent supports nested delegation of subtasks to child agents with sequential and parallel execution, dependency-aware topological batching, child-session save/resume, and lineage tracking via an agent manager.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:53:14Z","updated_by_operation":"op_0f837166a77e4254b223d0c0aed8c3a0"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:53:14Z","created_by_operation":"op_0f837166a77e4254b223d0c0aed8c3a0","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_a8e0574876e0254f123f26ac2881dcc17bd6f5242d0fa0b2eb45ca7fe446f1ad","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"harnesslab/claw-code-agent@167571da895b snapshot 76b0b0a684f15cec","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_8f08717574fa89cbea482ea32bac36ff1753bf8e60be7c8833dca8a46c7c4c85"],"source_ids":["src_4d39afdf29635e9fbfa9f7b3eb7a2a1a"],"text":"The README lists in-progress work including full MCP parity beyond stdio transport, full slash-command and REPL/TUI parity, hooks parity, real remote transport, voice/VIM modes, and editor integrations.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:53:14Z","updated_by_operation":"op_0f837166a77e4254b223d0c0aed8c3a0"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:53:14Z","created_by_operation":"op_0f837166a77e4254b223d0c0aed8c3a0","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_c22ee6215f0cb0c6400971b7b7c32809cfcc77d4b7e9ec8b6914905568f5449c","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"harnesslab/claw-code-agent@167571da895b snapshot 76b0b0a684f15cec","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_48ff40fc440675045727fdba93f6a02a46eff77497def8618151a25c75b52929","slc_e1d3471ff5a833788f81963150da2ccc1aece8e25d97c826be44940aa1fcea58","slc_f103f11d6c26802a0ea0bce4995f2ca1112377b54c535dfecd5f22deea1a731d"],"source_ids":["src_4d39afdf29635e9fbfa9f7b3eb7a2a1a"],"text":"Custom agent profiles are markdown files discovered from ./.claude/agents and ~/./.claude/agents, with project agents overriding user agents and user agents overriding built-ins on matching agent_type.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:53:14Z","updated_by_operation":"op_0f837166a77e4254b223d0c0aed8c3a0"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:53:14Z","created_by_operation":"op_0f837166a77e4254b223d0c0aed8c3a0","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_c500ca9edf6cdb55f280e288a1df0737c4a786b7eaa3f995694a973e39fc0592","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"harnesslab/claw-code-agent@167571da895b snapshot 76b0b0a684f15cec","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_ad3375253f695ab1c8ec058cd23722a467d66c71cca851829c0ece7568d30cb2"],"source_ids":["src_4d39afdf29635e9fbfa9f7b3eb7a2a1a"],"text":"The bundled web GUI uses FastAPI and Uvicorn, which are installed automatically when the package is installed via pip; the core runtime itself remains dependency-free.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:53:14Z","updated_by_operation":"op_0f837166a77e4254b223d0c0aed8c3a0"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:53:14Z","created_by_operation":"op_0f837166a77e4254b223d0c0aed8c3a0","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_dc501d1770064652a47c00c6461eae528180627b93237297fc124d8a9c8af849","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"harnesslab/claw-code-agent@167571da895b snapshot 76b0b0a684f15cec","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_73f28bbbcb28f6f8e153bf3328cca94dd60939166766cdb3a2441a2dcb3dd0b7","slc_bc4dfff1c61832ebe4a80657062d6b64845c54f34dd9c26615584b74b8d86360"],"source_ids":["src_4d39afdf29635e9fbfa9f7b3eb7a2a1a"],"text":"The CLI exposes commands such as agent, agent-chat, agent-bg/agent-ps/agent-logs/agent-kill for background sessions, agent-resume, agent-prompt, token-budget, and agents-create/update/delete, plus utility commands like summary, manifest, commands, and tools.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:53:14Z","updated_by_operation":"op_0f837166a77e4254b223d0c0aed8c3a0"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:53:14Z","created_by_operation":"op_0f837166a77e4254b223d0c0aed8c3a0","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_e03b5e10507be0f910a566f32a3592499a9077984518300204f443a6abadffcf","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"harnesslab/claw-code-agent@167571da895b snapshot 76b0b0a684f15cec","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_e02c4064ba4de07beb45c522e697960a02383599b19c731ae2b879d3221cdbc5"],"source_ids":["src_4d39afdf29635e9fbfa9f7b3eb7a2a1a"],"text":"The src/ tree includes modules for the agent loop (agent_runtime.py), tool execution (agent_tools.py), prompt assembly (agent_prompting.py), context building, session state, slash commands, nested-agent management, an OpenAI-compatible streaming client, and plugin runtime.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:53:14Z","updated_by_operation":"op_0f837166a77e4254b223d0c0aed8c3a0"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:53:14Z","created_by_operation":"op_0f837166a77e4254b223d0c0aed8c3a0","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_f0d7e17aa6885eeab207b7f3d003c51102202f1a660ec26310bf6fa100c0ae40","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"harnesslab/claw-code-agent@167571da895b snapshot 76b0b0a684f15cec","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_50af2f8ee15843ac60ee2ed8cbc92f29109463a8b3d0f5e5dd6df5eb81bb79a7","slc_e660ffe1ca0d6d87328a8f79902c9b1764f8ef60c2c2ec668b347741eff190e9"],"source_ids":["src_4d39afdf29635e9fbfa9f7b3eb7a2a1a"],"text":"Built-in tools include list_dir, read_file, write_file, edit_file, glob_search, grep_search, bash, web_fetch, web_search, tool_search, sleep, config/account/remote/MCP tools, and plan tools, each with a documented permission level.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:53:14Z","updated_by_operation":"op_0f837166a77e4254b223d0c0aed8c3a0"}
